[h1]Council Automation[/h1]

Your own council automation in place of the game's. You tick which council actions to use and rank them; the mod hands out the seats itself, down the list, each action going to the advisor best in its skill.

[b]How it works[/b]
[list]
[*] The «Own council automation» checkbox in the Community Mod Framework menu switches the game's «Council» automation off and hands out every seat at once.
[*] «Available»: every common council action your country can see. Ticked ones go to «Priority».
[*] «Priority»: the order in which actions try the seats. The action on top takes the best advisors, even from actions below it.
[*] Empty seats are filled every few months, all seats are reviewed less often; both are settings.
[*] Targets are checked against the game's own conditions: a province the game would not allow is never picked.
[/list]

[b]Beyond the game's automation[/b]
[list]
[*] [b]Assimilation to 50 %[/b]: brings every location of a province to half a primary or accepted culture, what integration and cores need, and moves on to the province with more such locations. Optionally each assimilation brings a control action with it.
[*] [b]Full assimilation[/b] and [b]area assimilation[/b] (the cultural hegemon's, from the third age).
[*] [b]Development[/b]: a province is developed while any of its locations is below the level you set; only where control is above a threshold; the number of advisors on it can be capped.
[*] [b]Control[/b]: an advisor keeps a province while its control still rises, then moves to the most valuable one short of it.
[*] [b]Societal values[/b]: the advisor takes the mod's own action «Shift values: <side>» and pushes a ticked pair wherever it moves at least a whole point. The engine does the shifting by the same rules as the game's own action; at the limit the mod takes the advisor off and gives the seat to the next action. The game's «Change Societal Values» stays yours to use by hand.
[*] [b]Diplomatic endeavors[/b] as two rows: a plain one, and one only while a coalition is forming against you.
[*] Integration, urbanization, pacification, recovery, estates, inflation, war exhaustion and the other common actions.
[/list]

[b]What it does not do[/b]
No country-specific actions and nothing as pointed as settling the frontier: common actions only.

[b]Requires[/b]
Community Mod Framework.

[b]Localization[/b]
English, Русский.

[i]The whole mod, this description included, was made with the help of an AI, tested as far as was possible, and its author is satisfied with the result.[/i]
